TI  - Early Detection of Coffee Leaf Rust Caused by Hemileia vastatrix Using Multispectral Images
AU  - Soares, Analis da Silva
AU  - Vieira, Bruno Sérgio
AU  - Bezerra, Thalita Almeida
AU  - Martins, George Deroco
